{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "92787f8895f6175f6e477921c2553fbdd0f3bee08a02a987bb2dae5c18f318c8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです……ふぁ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了……哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fa0127e464c56d384feca4ced02d2969925a76b6487091911df7f53166d343d4", "ja": "お疲れさま、百合子。\n……どうしたんだ？　何だか眠そうだけど。", "zh": "辛苦了，百合子。\n……怎么了？感觉你好像很困。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "2fba684e52adb64441c9296cd8165c71dda1ea83fc945f68aa3e94b8aab25f4e", "ja": "うう、すみません。昨日読んでた本が面白くて、\nちょっぴり夜更かししちゃいました……。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起。昨天看的书太有意思了，一不小心熬了会儿夜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0a3044cecba1d4bca44c3fbfef3dcdcfd0a83edae307bf12274676a8f170a43d", "ja": "そういう事か……寝不足には気をつけような！\nそれで、どんな本を読んでたんだ？", "zh": "原来是这样……可要注意别睡眠不足啊！\n那么，你读的是什么书？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "09b2640047b0ca7444b4896329c9eccbeb560f8de0526168d0998768e960b4d9", "ja": "はい、ヴァンパイアが主人公の小説なんです！\nこれが、すっごく面白くて……。", "zh": "是的，是一本以吸血鬼为主角的小说！\n这本书真的特别有意思……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "74db8fad123358319f9ee6b375a3952378f13a634c714cd25dd9d1a43e15b295", "ja": "上巻のラストで、ヴァンパイアの女の子と\n人間の男の子が、敵に追われて駆け落ちするんです。", "zh": "上卷结尾，吸血鬼女孩和人类男孩被敌人追赶，只好私奔了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "fa9b1d48a33acfea47456eaed8779349b50b9e886170f2f891802c43656d1ba8", "ja": "そんな強い引きで終わられたら、すぐにでも\n下巻を読みたくなっちゃうじゃありませんか！", "zh": "要是以这么强烈的悬念收尾，不就会让人忍不住马上想读下卷了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1007_p", "source_sha256": "de9c2fbec70089f505f05703c26eab578c22663d076cf9687b1113db708e4c20", "ja": "はは、そうだな。ヴァンパイアといえば、\n百合子も今度のイベントで演じる予定だったな。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。说到吸血鬼，百合子这次也要在活动中饰演吸血鬼来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "f2bc0adac0a2f05c5fb130bbe71a5bbb7a34cc6a4062edee9e5bbb4630c835fa", "ja": "はい！　私、この本のおかげで、\nヴァンパイアの気持ちがちょっとわかった気がします！", "zh": "是的！多亏了这本书，\n我感觉自己稍微理解了一点吸血鬼的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "5dda1c34795f064c5ff232338b40ca44704eb19560a75c31f70adfeeea6f5dab", "ja": "今日も、ちょっと日差しがまぶしいくらいで……\nハッ！　まさか、私もヴァンパイアに……！？", "zh": "今天阳光也只是稍微有点刺眼而已……\n啊！难道说，我也变成吸血鬼了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d572281fac6982d6d1930fa69f25cd05f2e5ed8e52ef88185ba2289435fac542", "ja": "いや、それは……\n夜更かしのしすぎなだけじゃないか？", "zh": "不，那只是……\n熬夜熬过头了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "82eb766cf418cc90eba0c2c377ccf0af2fbb9cb661eb7273108eb0c126270ceb", "ja": "いえ、それだけじゃないんです。\nなんだかすごく、のどが渇いてるような……。", "zh": "不，不仅是那样。\n总觉得非常口渴……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "7571b7794b94aec69c81e384772712fdbc9447c82101174cda2fad5febfb3884", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さん。もしも私が、\n本当にヴァンパイアになってしまったら……。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生。要是我，\n真的变成吸血鬼的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "153257b115e343ecfa621da8cbdacd4a0248ac36489b45641e79ceddb54de4fd", "ja": "その時は、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "到那时，我就会变成{$P$}先生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e9b89d302926f367409cb289890e5ae29721a315f8ec39fad36895bd040a2ced", "ja": "えっ、百合子？　そんな、まさか……。\n冗談だよな？", "zh": "诶，百合子？不会吧，怎么可能……。\n你是在开玩笑吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1016_p", "source_sha256": "98cab1c46fa96ac7730f41bbabd248d18f6574bb1ce409736fac7b7732e9e1f1", "ja": "百合子？", "zh": "百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "3a9c4f279cc08dc71ba30fd8a47e9a97862b92b8d72edbee1a720828bdfd147f", "ja": "うぅ……ご、ごめんなさい！\n私やっぱり、ヴァンパイアにはなれそうもありません！", "zh": "呜呜……对、对不起！\n我果然还是没办法变成吸血鬼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "79b99e43b18bb5d9a2f09f849bb4ea4587ef63ede183c1134551922c3207fad1", "ja": "だって{$P$}さんの首筋に、\nく、口をつけるなんて……そんなの絶対ムリです！", "zh": "可是，要、要把嘴唇贴到{$P$}先生的脖颈上……这种事我绝对做不到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1019_p", "source_sha256": "fb6a3d0d8d10892c3ba6adbabfb7655fbe4d58160a573bb1442cdb6fc1e4efea", "ja": "いや、本物じゃないなら必要ないから……でも、\n今の演技は良かったよ。本番も、その調子で頼んだぞ！", "zh": "不用，要不是真的就不需要了……不过，\n刚才的演技很好。正式演出也要保持这个状态，加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "64b16d75f4076ea9cd1d8645fcfe1befa34946195ce9de067bf09b1c003581b8", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか？　わかりました！\n私、本番でもヴァンパイアとして、がんばりますね！", "zh": "真、真的吗？我明白了！\n正式演出时，我也会作为吸血鬼努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0153_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e113223a0ba5aee337f0fc56942f81b707243dd6f3cac7a90d20eb986a2b58ff", "ja": "（頑張る方向が、少しずれているような気もするけど\n……百合子はやる気みたいだし、本番に期待しよう！）", "zh": "（她努力的方向，好像有点偏了……不过百合子干劲十足，就期待正式演出吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
